{21}{Well, looks like you finally showed up, @PCNAME@. I was very close to sending out a search party to look ya up. And let me make something clear right from the start: ya might have been hot manur where ya came from, but here you're just another rookie detective....  Learn your place here and we'll get along just fine.....Oh, and welcome aboard I guess.}{Well, looks like you finally showed up, @PCNAME@. I was very close to sending out a search party to look ya up. And let me make something clear right from the start: ya might have been hot manur where ya came from, but here you're just another rookie detective....  Learn your place here and we'll get along just fine.....Oh, and welcome aboard I guess.}{}{}{}{qu 1001 4}
